WEBVTT

00:04:54.236 --> 00:05:01.196
Astoundingly, that rise began
just as world food prices were falling.

00:05:02.036 --> 00:05:03.556
So what's going on?

00:05:03.596 --> 00:05:06.676
Well, the world food system,
like global finance,

00:05:06.716 --> 00:05:08.116
is a complex system,

00:05:08.156 --> 00:05:11.916
and complex systems
behave in counterintuitive ways.

00:05:12.396 --> 00:05:15.556
They're resilient
under certain conditions,

00:05:15.556 --> 00:05:20.756
because there’s weird self-organizing
dynamics [to] stabilize them.

00:05:21.276 --> 00:05:25.476
But if they're pushed
by an extreme amount of stress,

00:05:25.476 --> 00:05:28.396
then those same self-organizing dynamics

00:05:28.436 --> 00:05:32.076
can start transmitting shocks
across the network.